{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Its firepan.</b> A division, and the sages said that it is strangled, corresponding to its measure." "<b>Upon his flesh.</b> A euphemism for nakedness, and likewise a zav from his flesh." "<b>That the fire shall eat.</b> What remains from the eating of the fire." "<b>Beside the altar.</b> Outside, on the east side."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:44.046974890Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}